'''Zollow''' (テバムラサキホネツバメ, ''Tebamurasaki Hone Tsubame'') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Brollow]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. He was added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]].

